    <S id="ILCAA_KANAKANAVU_TEXTS_012_HUNTING_S0001">
        <FORM kindOf="original">iiku miana ia, mia ma-ima-ən u-supatə cainana, paira=ku maamia mu-a-kusa rəməəra ara-cakan mu-a-panaʔə laalə.</FORM>
        <PHON kindOf="original">iiku miana ia mia maimaən usupatə ʦainana pairaku maamia muakusa rəməəra araʦakan muapanaʔə ɾaaɾə</PHON>
        <FORM kindOf="standard">iiku miana ia, mia maimaen usupate cainana, pairaku maamia muakusa remeera aracakan muapana'e raare.</FORM>
        <PHON kindOf="standard">iiku miana ia mia maimaen usupate ʦainana pai[r|ɾ]aku maamia muakusa [r|ɾ]emee[r|ɾ]a a[r|ɾ]aʦakan muapanaʔe [r|ɾ]aa[r|ɾ]e</PHON>
        <TRANSL xml:lang="eng">In the past, when I was 54 years old, I often went hunting and shooting flying squirrels in the mountains.</TRANSL>
